@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant "System" as System

activate Editor

    Editor -> System : Request to create a new map
    activate System

    System --> Editor : Prompt for map name
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : Submit **invalid** map name
    activate System

    System --> Editor: Display error message:\n"ERROR. Invalid name. Name shouldn't start with a space, \nhyphen, or underline. Must be under 15 characters. Must have, at least, one upper\ncase character."
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System: Submit **valid** map name
    activate System

    System --> Editor: Provides size list
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System: Submit **valid** size option
    activate System

    System --> Editor: Display success message:\n"Map created successfully."

    deactivate System
    deactivate Editor

@enduml
